# owl-complement-of: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/owl-complementOf.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:Vertebrate owl:complementOf :Invertebrate.

# Inference rules
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.

{?C owl:complementOf ?D} => {?D owl:complementOf ?C}.
{?C owl:complementOf ?D} => {?D owl:disjointWith ?C}.
{?C owl:complementOf ?D. ?X a ?C. ?X a ?D} => false.
